{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "176b07ac-0ba1-86f7-89f3-3510af3f2c37",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T12:25:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:21:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Happy Tuesday, what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is silly, but I'm on speakerphone, I'm in the van with my partner driving. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:21:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you're coming through fine. A little road noise but I've got you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:21:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Sorry. So it's about the storm drain on Mill Street. It flooded again after the snow turned to rain, Sunday into Monday, and I'm just, I'm tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:22:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, storm drain on Mill Street. What's the number, or closest house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:22:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One sixty-two Mill Street, up on the Hill. Sorry, the drain's right out front, by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One sixty-two Mill. Got it. And when you say flooded, is it water in the street, in the house, what are we looking at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street. The whole low spot just fills up like a pond. My car was parked right there and the water came up over the [inaudible] and got into the footwell. The carpet's soaked. Sorry, I know a car is a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's a hassle. Anything in the basement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, the basement's dry. It's always been dry, never had a drop down there. It's just the street. But it happens every time we get real rain or a thaw, and nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So water in the street, car got wet, house is fine. Writing that down. Is the drain itself blocked, you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:23:16-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sorry, I'm pretty sure. It's packed with leaves and gravel and whatever the plows pushed in. And the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit now, [line breaks up] you can't even walk on it without slipping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:23:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up there. Said the sidewalk is what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:23:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sheet of mud and grit. All of it washed up out of the drain and across the sidewalk. My neighbor with the cane can't get by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:23:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Mud and grit all over the sidewalk, drain's clogged with debris. So what you're asking is for the crew to come clean out that drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Sorry, that's all I want. Just get it cleaned before the next storm, because this is the second time I've called about the thing sitting full of junk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, I don't see a ticket pulled up under that address just yet, but I'll put this one in fresh and mark that it's been an ongoing issue. Crews are slammed after a storm like this one, so it'll go in the queue, but I'll flag the car and the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:24:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I just, it keeps happening and then everybody acts surprised."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled, or just let it get done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:24:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back would be great. Sorry, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ellen Almy. A-L-M-Y. Sorry, people always put an E in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Almy, no E. Perfect. So that's Ellen Almy, one sixty-two Mill Street, clogged storm drain, street flooding, mud on the sidewalk, request to clean it out. I'll send it over to the drain crew today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:25:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Sorry for rambling, we're on the road and it's loud in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all good. Drive safe, Ellen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin. Bye."
    }
  ],
